From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yodaliu <yodaliu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:32:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 12/15] pinctrl: qcom: spmi-gpio: delay 100 ms at end of probe

Reconstructed from the stock FiiO M21 FW 1.1.0 module by disassembly
comparison; the rebuilt module matches the stock one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-spmi-gpio.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-spmi-gpio.c b/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-spmi-gpio.c
index d19b1fbb1f2..cc03aa09c66 100644
--- a/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-spmi-gpio.c
+++ b/drivers/pinctrl/qcom/pinctrl-spmi-gpio.c
@@ -1174,6 +1174,7 @@ static int pmic_gpio_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 		}
 	}
 
+	mdelay(100);
 	return 0;
 
 err_range:
